{"pageProps":{"meta":{"id":"obsidian:free-api-openrouter-text-20261102-en","title":"OpenRouter Free API Test: After 12 Requests, Which Models Really Gave Answers","date":"2026-11-03","updated":"2026-11-13","summary":"Records of twelve requests for success, rate limiting, invalidation, and truncation.","categories":[{"id":"markdown-category-0-Resources","name":"Resources","color":"default"}],"categoryNames":["Resources"],"tags":[{"id":"markdown-tag-0-Free API","name":"Free API","color":"default"}],"image":"/obsidian-assets/free-api-openrouter-text-20261102/cover-7d5f1c20b7.jpg","coverBlockId":null,"slug":"free-api-openrouter-text-20261102-en","legacyPaths":[],"lang":"en","translationOf":"free-api-openrouter-text-20261102","articleType":"article","discoveryName":"OpenRouter Free API Test: After 12 Requests, Which Models Really Gave Answers","discoveryCategory":null,"discoveryStage":null,"discoveryUrl":null,"source":"markdown","fixedProductFooter":true},"markdownHtml":"<blockquote>\n<p><strong>Info: Machine translation</strong>\nThis post was machine-translated from the Chinese original. Wording may be rough in places — the <a href=\"https://hyphentech.top/free-api-openrouter-text-20261102/\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"Opens in a new tab · https://hyphentech.top/free-api-openrouter-text-20261102/\">Chinese version</a> is authoritative.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>Summary</strong>\n12 real requests: answers, rate limiting, old models, and half JSON\nHyphenTech · Data and measurements from November 2, 2026</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>OpenRouter first round of two free models both returned 429. I kept trying other free local configurations before finally getting the full order answer. Among the 12 requests, there were correct results, as well as names translated, output was truncated, and the old model 404. You can’t stop at the first two errors, nor just pick the later successes.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://hyphentech.top/obsidian-assets/free-api-openrouter-text-20261102/image-openrouter-home-ae37757593.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/2feef98676ec6bfc1512aba1-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/2feef98676ec6bfc1512aba1-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"https://hyphentech.top/obsidian-assets/free-api-openrouter-text-20261102/image-openrouter-home-ae37757593.png\" alt=\"OpenRouter Official Website\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1600\"></picture></a></p>\n<p>OpenRouter puts multiple model vendors in the same interface, like a mall with many stalls. Getting a mall pass doesn’t mean every stall is stocked, equally free, or just as crowded. When connecting, check the exact model and the actual routing for this time.</p>\n<h2>For the same order, leave the original result for each item</h2>\n<p>This time, I used the correct total price of 3400 yuan for equipment orders, requiring fixed JSON fields. This time, I used an existing account, and the local HyphenBox forwarded the request to the corresponding platform. The timing was from the request sent locally to the completion of the response, including network and service waiting; Each model’s order question was only run once. The account was configured to free mode and did not read the final bill.</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Request model/task</th>\n<th>Completing it takes time</th>\n<th>Actually return</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free &lt;br&gt;order</td>\n<td>3.175 seconds</td>\n<td>429; call failed</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>cohere/north-mini-code: &lt;br&gt;free order</td>\n<td>2.916 seconds</td>\n<td>200; the total price is correct, and the equipment name is translated into English</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>dots-studio/dots-3-note-preview: &lt;br&gt;free order</td>\n<td>3.517 seconds</td>\n<td>200; JSON field and amount match the standard answer</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>inclusionai/ling-3.0-flash-fin:free &lt;br&gt;order</td>\n<td>1.135 seconds</td>\n<td>404; Call failed</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>inclusionai/ling-3.0-flash-sante: &lt;br&gt;free order</td>\n<td>0.491 seconds</td>\n<td>404; Call failed</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b: &lt;br&gt;free order</td>\n<td>0.296 seconds</td>\n<td>404; Call failed</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>nvidia/Nemotron-3-Ultra-550B-A55B: &lt;br&gt;Free order</td>\n<td>7.821 seconds</td>\n<td>200; JSON field and amount match the standard answer</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Nvidia/Nemotron-3.5-Lightning: &lt;br&gt;Free order</td>\n<td>29.515 seconds</td>\n<td>200; Returns incomplete content, JSON cannot parse it</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OpenRouter/Free &lt;br&gt;order</td>\n<td>3.061 seconds</td>\n<td>200; JSON field and amount match the standard answer</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>poolside/laguna-s-2.1: &lt;br&gt;Free order</td>\n<td>0.293 seconds</td>\n<td>404; Call failed</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>poolside/laguna-xs-2.1: Free &lt;br&gt;order</td>\n<td>0.255 seconds</td>\n<td>404; Call failed</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Liquid/lfm-2.5-2.6b: Free &lt;br&gt;orders</td>\n<td>1.195 seconds</td>\n<td>429; call failed</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<blockquote>\n<p>This machine forwards via HyphenBox; One request per line, not multi-turn averaging. Time consumption includes network and upstream waiting.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><a href=\"https://hyphentech.top/obsidian-assets/free-api-openrouter-text-20261102/image-openrouter-chart-46d9321d38.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/6745d64a6229a2294bbcb279-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/6745d64a6229a2294bbcb279-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"https://hyphentech.top/obsidian-assets/free-api-openrouter-text-20261102/image-openrouter-chart-46d9321d38.png\" alt=\"Order Request Actual Data\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1500\" height=\"1440\"></picture></a></p>\n<p>dots-studio/dots-3-note-preview: free gives a complete correct result after 3.517 seconds; nvidia/nemotron-3-ultra-550b-a55b: free gives a full correct result after 7.821 seconds. Below is one of the original answers.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-JSON\">\n\n{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;设备A&quot;,&quot;quantity&quot;:2,&quot;unit_price&quot;:1200,&quot;subtotal&quot;:2400},{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;设备B&quot;,&quot;quantity&quot;:3,&quot;unit_price&quot;:350,&quot;subtotal&quot;:1050}],&quot;shipping&quot;:80,&quot;discount&quot;:130,&quot;total&quot;:3400}\n</code></pre>\n<p>Specify the free model for original return</p>\n<h2>Free automatic routing depends on which one actually lands</h2>\n<p>Once a request was selected as openrouter/free, and the return model field was nvidia/nemotron-3-nano-omni-30b-a3b-reasoning:free, completed in 3.061 seconds. This was an automatic routing result, not an independent test I performed directly on this NVIDIA model. Save the request name and return name to reproduce exactly what you used.</p>\n<p>cohere/north-mini-code: The amount for free is correct, but write “Device A/Device B” as “Device A/Device B”. It’s not a big problem for a quick reading; If subsequent programs must match the product by the original name, then the field must be followed. This is recorded separately from the total price calculation error.</p>\n<h2>200 may only get half an answer</h2>\n<p>nvidia/nemotron-3.5-lightning:free took 29.515 seconds this time, HTTP is 200, but JSON is not closed, finish_reason is length. The max_tokens of this round of requests is 1024; After the output budget is exhausted, the task is not yet finished. Inference models may also consume internal inference budget, so the returned usage information needs to be checked together.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-真实记录摘录\">HTTP 200\nfinish_reason: length\n本次请求 max_tokens: 1024\n实际验收：JSON不完整，无法解析\n</code></pre>\n<p>This time, I didn’t retest after raising the budget, so I kept “This configuration is not complete” and casually rated it as the capability limit for this model. On the program side, you can check HTTP status, reason for termination, whether JSON can parse, and key fields simultaneously, rather than treating 200 as “completed.”</p>\n<h2>How do you find the free model, and how do you fill in the key and address?</h2>\n<p>Apply for your own key from the OpenRouter key page <a href=\"https://openrouter.ai/settings/keys\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"Opens in a new tab · https://openrouter.ai/settings/keys\">⟧</a>, base address <a href=\"https://openrouter.ai/api/v1\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"Opens in a new tab · https://openrouter.ai/api/v1\">https://openrouter.ai/api/v1</a>. Find the current free model in the model directory <a href=\"https://openrouter.ai/models\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"Opens in a new tab · https://openrouter.ai/models\">and</a>, verify the input and output prices, then copy the full name. Keep the ‘free’ at the end of the name; do not mistake the paid model with the same name as the free version.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://hyphentech.top/obsidian-assets/free-api-openrouter-text-20261102/image-openrouter-limits-df244d9ee5.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/94aa2282d1a0aaca5570423c-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/94aa2282d1a0aaca5570423c-820.webp 820w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"https://hyphentech.top/obsidian-assets/free-api-openrouter-text-20261102/image-openrouter-limits-df244d9ee5.png\" alt=\"OpenRouter Official Limit\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"820\" height=\"970\"></picture></a></p>\n<p>The daily request quota depends on the current account. This round does not read your account equity and does not provide the same number for everyone. 429 waits for rate limit restoration; 404 first checks whether the model is still in the current directory; Negative balances may also prevent free calls. View benefits after recharge and accounts without recharge separately.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>Quote: My judgment</strong>\nWant to try multiple free text models with one entry, OpenRouter is convenient. This round has a successful answer, but rate limiting, availability, and output format differ significantly between different ports. For fixed tasks, specify the model first; When using automatic routing, record the actual returned model.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>Main sources of verification</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://openrouter.ai/\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"Opens in a new tab · https://openrouter.ai/\">OpenRouter Official Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://openrouter.ai/docs/api-reference/limits\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"Opens in a new tab · https://openrouter.ai/docs/api-reference/limits\">OpenRouter Free Call Limit</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://openrouter.ai/models\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"Opens in a new tab · https://openrouter.ai/models\">OpenRouter Model Directory</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://openrouter.ai/docs/quickstart\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"Opens in a new tab · https://openrouter.ai/docs/quickstart\">OpenRouter Access Documentation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://openrouter.ai/settings/keys\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"Opens in a new tab · https://openrouter.ai/settings/keys\">OpenRouter Key Management</a></li>\n</ul>\n","relatedPosts":[{"id":"obsidian:free-api-image-directory-20261102","rawId":"obsidian:free-api-image-directory-20261102","slug":"free-api-image-directory-20261102-en","legacyPaths":[],"title":"How to choose a free drawing API: password-free, periodic quota, and new user trial materials directory","date":"2026-11-03","updated":"2026-11-03","summary":"First, look at the actual original image, then select the drawing interface from the free source.","categories":[{"id":"markdown-category-0-资源分享","name":"资源分享","color":"default"}],"categoryNames":["资源分享"],"tags":[{"id":"markdown-tag-0-Free API","name":"Free API","color":"default"}],"pageCover":"/obsidian-assets/free-api-image-directory-20261102/cover-b1ccd2dbec.jpg","cover":"/obsidian-assets/free-api-image-directory-20261102/cover-b1ccd2dbec.jpg","source":"markdown","status":"published","lang":"en","translationOf":null,"articleType":"article","discoveryName":"免费绘图API怎么选：免密、周期额度和新人试用资料目录","discoveryCategory":null,"discoveryStage":null,"discoveryUrl":null,"sourcePath":"posts/free-api-image-directory-20261102.md","fixedProductFooter":true},{"id":"obsidian:free-api-text-trial-directory-20261102","rawId":"obsidian:free-api-text-trial-directory-20261102","slug":"free-api-text-trial-directory-20261102-en","legacyPaths":[],"title":"How long can the free text API trial quota last? A summary of new user bonuses and evaluation interfaces by category","date":"2026-11-03","updated":"2026-11-03","summary":"Classification and organization of new employee bonuses, evaluation keys, and expiration conditions.","categories":[{"id":"markdown-category-0-资源分享","name":"资源分享","color":"default"}],"categoryNames":["资源分享"],"tags":[{"id":"markdown-tag-0-Free API","name":"Free API","color":"default"}],"pageCover":"/obsidian-ass